There's a comment in the level description for the Priest quest
(dat/Priest.des) saing "Unattended Altar - unaligned due to conflict -
player must align it."  So it would seem you're not only allowed but
even expected to do it.

> So what happens if you #offer on an unaligned alter?

As far as I can tell from the source, there's nothing special about
unaligned altars outside Gehennom.  You can convert them just like any
other altar.  Wizmode testing seems to confirm this.

(You can't convert yourself to Moloch, though: if you try to convert
an unaligned altar while your god is angry, you'll "just" make your
god even angrier and lose some luck, wis and alignment.)

